* Model latency, token usage, and error rates rise simultaneously after a deployment. How would you correlate telemetry and determine whether to roll back?
* Customers report more hallucinations, but infrastructure metrics look healthy. How would you measure answer quality and investigate retrieval or prompt changes?
* An AI provider outage causes a backlog of requests and a sharp cost increase during recovery. How would you control replay, prioritize traffic, and restore service safely?
